  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">DESO skallf genomf&#xF6;ra ett pilotprojekt under &#xE5;r 2000-2001 i syfte att utveckla integrerade strategier f&#xF6;r FNs fonder och program samt f&#xF6;r relevanta fackorgan inom FN. Under projektperioden skall Sida succes sivt l&#xE4;mna f&#xF6;rslag till samlade strategier f&#xF6;r sveriges agerande i olika FN-organ f&#xF6;r UD.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida will carry out a pilot project during 2000 to 2001 with intentionto develop integrated strategies for UN funds and programmes as well as relevant speicialized agencies within UN. During the project periodas relevant speicialized agencies within UN. During the project periodForeign Affairs for Sweden&apos;s acting in UN-agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
